   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Rodrigo,<div>This is not currently something that can changed: AetherPackageFactory is hardcoded to use Maven&#39;s default directory at ~/.m2/repository for the sake of compatibility.</div><div><br></div><div>The AetherPackageLoader could be parametrized to accept an alternative directory. If you open an issue on Github I&#39;ll try to take a look at this week. </div><div><br></div><div>-Alex</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
